New Mexico QSO Party -- the 33 New Mexico counties, each its own multiplier.
Three-letter codes from the sponsor's county check sheet (2026 NMQP Form Packet, last modified 09 April 2026), fetched 2026-10-26.
No county maps to the state: the rules count each NM county as a multiplier of its own for every entrant.
No INCLUDE here: an out-of-state entrant's table holds only the counties (the host-area rule reads it).
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

